{"type":"text","text":"Subject: Harbor Hall update: March 12 confirmed; contract for your review\n\nHi Dana,\n\nHope you’re having a good week. I spoke with Priya yesterday—here’s where things stand with Harbor Hall:\n\n- **Date:** March 12 is confirmed, our original date.\n- **Walkthrough:** They can do March 3. Let me know if that works for you or if you have a conflict.\n- **Budget:** The final cost is $4,200, slightly under what we planned. They waived the AV setup fee since we’re bringing our own projector. The quote covers up to 85 guests, which is right around our current RSVP count, so we should be fine unless we get a wave of late sign-ups.\n- **Contract:** They sent a draft. I read through it and nothing stood out as unusual, but I’d like you to take a look before I sign. Could you review it by Friday? That’s when I plan to send back the signed copy.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions or want to talk it through. Happy to hop on a call.\n\nThanks,\nSam\n\nI tightened the intro, made the key details skimmable, and replaced “if I don’t hear back” with a clear Friday deadline so the ask isn’t easy to miss."}
